Package: luci-app-salt-openwrt
Version: 0.1.1-1
Depends: luci-base, salt-openwrt
Section: luci
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Christian Prior-Mamulyan <cprior@gmail.com>
Description: LuCI app for Salt agent configuration
 Configure Salt agent mode (audit/oneshot/autoverified/humanreviewed),
 enable/disable, rollback timeout, and view last run status from the
 LuCI web interface.
